<title>USA: Hughes Supply to acquire nickel pipe co.</title>
<headline>Hughes Supply to acquire nickel pipe co.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Supply Inc said Wednesday that it has reached an agreement in principle to acquire  J&amp;J Inc for an undisclosed cash price.</p>
<p>According to Hughes, J&amp;J is one of the largest independent providers of nickel and nickel alloy pipe and fittings in the United States.</p>
<p>The company said it anticipates that the transaction will close by October 3l.</p>
</text>
